# Training web

- Use TypeScript, functional components, and server components by default. [why: convention]
- Keep styling in CSS classes. No `style` and no `CSSProperties`. [why: convention]
- Keep user-visible copy in the content file that owns the screen. [why: convention]
- Poll answer writes use the public CRM key against `PUT /www/v1/polls/{slug}/answers`. [why: convention]
- When behavior changes, update the existing tests and fixtures. Do not add Playwright. [why: convention]
